        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International AP-PH-4803, 12 Inch Twisted Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Twisted Refrigerator Pull made by RK International has a traditional style that manages to be fancy without being overly so. It will add character to any appliance including refrigerators, ovens, and even dishwashers. Adding your own pull to your kitchen appliances gives the whole room a cohesive and stately appearance. The 12 Inch Twisted Appliance Pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware. It is available in 7 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/twist-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-800\"><b>Twist Cabinet Pull</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/twisted-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-702\"><b>Twist Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the AP-PH-4803 12 Inch Twist Appliance Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator/appliance door panel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR50_size.gif?v=1704354712\" width=\"586\" height=\"116\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
